  "title": "Sweet and Sour Meatballs in Sauce",
  "description": "A unique twist on traditional meatballs, these are baked in a wonderful tomato-based sweet and sour sauce, which is delicious over rice!",
  "authors": [
    "Rebekah Rose Hills"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:46:32-04:00",
